            <ArticleTitle>IVUS-guided wiring technique: promising approach for the chronic total occlusion.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>381-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report on two cases of IVUS-guided wiring technique performed on chronic total occlusion using stiffer wires and low-profile intracoronary ultrasound catheter. This technique helped improve a success rate of chronic total occlusion case.</AbstractText>
